        <td class="text"><P>Tuesday night was retro-night at Club VM. This was also billed as "A night in Luclin with friends." Now, I'll be brutally honest, I basically skipped the entire Luclin expansin playing Dark Age of Camelot, which meant that Tuesday night I got my <A href="http://eqbeastiary.allakhazam.com/search.shtml?id=7898" target=_blank>Emperor Ssraeshza</A> cherry popped. I'm sure that the Emperor fight was probably a whole lot more exciting before the launch of Planes of Power and the advent of 5 new levels and ungodly amounts of AA points. I'm sure that a 3 Cleric, 1 Druid CH team wouldn't have cut it pre-PoP either. And I'm pretty sure that a flawless kill given that sort of healing power would have been virtually impossible. I'm equally sure that the loot probably wouldn't have been as crappy as it was last night.</P>
